  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **pork roll**: back after 439 archived shows (5419 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **spinal**: rare: 8 archived performances [5]\n- **eel**: rare: 3 archived performances [5]\n- **happy marbles**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **learnin**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **even if**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **buckingham**: rare: 4 archived performances [5]\n- **mutilated**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2008-03-10.Honolulu** (recommended): source not stated; 44 songs; 220 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: The recording picks up a lot of loud talkers and crowd chatter, though it remains listenable [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The encore was enormous, and the reviewer says it was the biggest they had ever seen [2]\n- Ween played in Hawaii, with a set running over three and a half hours [4]\n- The band was in top form and the crowd was wild [4]\n- Reviewer says the recording sounds like a classic Ween show and has the best setlist they've seen in years [2]\n- Reviewer says this encore was the longest they have ever seen [3]",
